<title>PHILIPPINES: Meralco Q1 up at 1.10 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Meralco Q1 up at 1.10 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	    14.64 vs 12.04</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	   1.10 vs 1.02</p>
<p>Note: Full name Manila Electric Co. It said sales volume in the first quarter rose by 5.4 percent to 4.2 billion kwh from the year-earlier 3.98 billion.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
